OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA chilly but bright start.
OL,6,FTurning cloudy into the afternoon from
OL,7,Fthe west, with this thickening before
OL,8,Fthe rain arriving into the evening.
OL,9,FFeeling pleasant in the sunshine and
OL,10,Flight winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy with persistent rain
OL,13,Ftonight, heavy at times into the early
OL,14,Fhours of Friday. Feeling much milder
OL,15,Fthan last night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FRain, sometimes heavy, will
OL,18,Fclear into the afternoon to become
OL,19,Fbright with a few scattered showers
OL,20,Fand a strong westerly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
