OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FScattered showers continuing through
OL,7,FSaturday, easing into Sunday alongside
OL,8,Fwinds allowing for plenty of sunshine.
OL,9,FCloud building through the evening
OL,10,Fwith rain to follow into Monday.
